{"id":"wb-6-617","name":"曾庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"曾廟","text":"曾庙，又称曾子庙、宗圣庙，是历代祭祀曾参的专庙，位于山东省嘉祥县城南23公里的南武山南麓。曾参（前505年－前435年），字子舆，春秋时代末期鲁国南武城（今山东嘉祥]）人，儒家主要代表人物之一，孔子的弟子，世称“曾子”、“宗圣”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9B%BE%E5%BB%9F","revisionId":86856493,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856493","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1ec92419df3384469a5c97b0.jpg","title":"Jiaxiang_Zeng_Miao_2015.08.14_10-19-34.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jiaxiang_Zeng_Miao_2015.08.14_10-19-34.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/Jiaxiang_Zeng_Miao_2015.08.14_10-19-34.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"嘉祥曾庙——\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}